  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diversity &amp; Inclusion: LIVES Art Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Japan, it is rare to see Artwork in office spaces. Some offices have big meeting rooms they use frequently and nothing on the wall. There are many positive benefits that an Artwork can create. In addition, Outsider Art in Japan is undervalued compared to other countries. This project will help two needs where it will increase productivity in the workplace by displaying Art in office space and will also lead to appropriate evaluation of Outsider artwork and its purchasing.</narrative>
  </description>
